<!-- Main content -->
<main class="container py-5">

    <h1><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> About Us</h1>

    <h3 class="mt-4">Welcome to JAC Trades</h3>

    <p>
        JAC Trades is an online car reselling platform designed
        to make buying and selling used vehicles easier.
        Our website allows customers to explore available
        vehicles and provides sellers with a simple way to
        list their cars for sale.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-4">What We Do</h3>

    <p>
        We provide a platform where sellers can submit
        information about their vehicles, including the make,
        model, year, mileage, price, condition, and location.
        Buyers can browse these listings and compare
        available cars based on their preferences and budget.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-4">Our Goal</h3>

    <p>
        Our goal is to create a simple and convenient
        experience for people interested in buying or
        selling used cars. We aim to make vehicle information
        easy to access and help customers explore their
        options before making a decision.
    </p>

</main>
